<title>UK: TELKOM AT $29.125 IN LONDON AT 0941 GMT.</title>
<headline>TELKOM AT $29.125 IN LONDON AT 0941 GMT.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>PT Telkom traded at $29.125 and London at 0941 GMT on Thursday. It recorded the day's low of $29 and the day's high of $29.7.</p>
<p>Its previous close on Wednesday $30.375. One ADS represents 20 ordinary shares -- Jakarta newsroom (Tel: 6221-3846364).</p>
</text>
